Track all changes/progress in the Odoo production task — **over the Odoo connector (claude.ai, the user's own account), never claude-in-chrome**. All calls, field conventions, context flags and gotchas live in the **`odoo-tickets` skill** — read it once at pipeline start, follow it for every prod task op below. The connector only ever reaches production; there is no local Odoo MCP. Phase-3 verification targets THIS session through `{{ odoo_cmd }} shell -c <CONF>` (and `psql -d <DB>`), so a check can never land on production by a parked connection.

