In a split run the mother's Phase 1 ends here and a child takes Phases 2–6; a single
session goes on to Phase 2.

**Group the tasks.** Tickets on the same module or the same files are one group: one child,
one worktree env, one PR. An independent ticket is a group of its own. Several groups start
in parallel, one brief each.

**Write the brief**, one per child, in these sections and this order. A child knows only what
its brief says and what it reads itself, so the brief carries the decisions, not the
conversation:

