    You are a child session of the pipeline. Load the pipeline skill with
    `child <TASK-KEYS>` and follow its "Child session" part. Questions go to the
    mother, the session that started you, with SendMessage; never guess the user's call.

    ## Task
    <each key with its ticket link and title>; the goal in two to four sentences;
    slug <{{ ticket_prefix.lower() }}-key-lower>-<short-kebab-desc>; the run's {% if use_kb %}kb task{% else %}WIP entry{% endif %} [<WIP_ID>].
    <the Phase-1 scope summary: modules, Technical Solution highlights>

