## Handling User Feedback Mid-Pipeline

{% if tickets_mcp == 'odoo' %}
1. **Post internal note** to the Odoo task documenting feedback
{% if task_software_fields %}
2. **Capture clarifying Q&A**: if the feedback answered a question you asked,
